[00:28.00]1. As your Son rose up from the Jordan
[00:34.20]And your precious words filled his heart,
[00:40.94]He was deeply moved by your purpose,
[00:47.60]And he longed to play his part.
[00:53.84]He refused to yield to temptation.
[00:59.96]He was zealous for your name.
[01:07.00]He gave ev’rything he could give you,
[01:13.86]And I long to do the same.
[01:19.74](Chorus)
[01:19.74]To do your will is my delight.
[01:25.74]I give you all my strength and might.
[01:33.32]This joy I feel; this joy is real.
[01:40.22]I will walk on in your light.
[01:46.10]To do your will is my delight.
[01:52.42]I have a hope so clear and bright.
[01:58.78]Your love I feel; your love is real.
[02:06.28]I will praise you day and night.
[02:12.48]It’s my delight.
[02:18.82]2. As I’ve come to know you, Jehovah,
[02:25.98]I’ve found happiness deep inside.
[02:32.58]I will gladly speak as your witness,
[02:38.78]And your truth I will not hide.
[02:45.84]Serving side by side with my brothers,
[02:51.50]There’s no better way to live.
[02:58.50]I will bear your name, oh, so proudly.
[03:04.80]I’ll give all that I can give.
[03:11.06](Chorus)
[03:11.46]To do your will is my delight.
[03:18.02]I give you all my strength and might.
[03:23.88]This joy I feel; this joy is real.
[03:31.16]I will walk on in your light.
[03:36.70]To do your will is my delight.
[03:43.96]I have a hope so clear and bright.
[03:50.38]Your love I feel; your love is real.
[03:57.14]I will praise you day and night.
[04:02.74]It’s my delight.
[04:08.92]Your will is my delight.
